( Effective deceleration at the end of the queue, exact-stop vs blended.       )
( Each move is the last in the queue when it ends, so its final ramp is the    )
( planner bringing the machine to rest. 180 mm is far more than the 15.6 mm    )
( needed to reach 250 mm/s at 2000 mm/s^2, so both ramps start from cruise.    )
G21 G90 G94
G61                 ( exact stop: the segment carries TC_TERM_COND_STOP       )
G0 X90
G4 P0.5             ( let the queue drain and the velocity settle at zero      )
G64 P0.05           ( blended: the segment carries TC_TERM_COND_PARABOLIC     )
G0 X-90
G4 P0.5
M2
